# Independent saved-natal primitive review

Frozen patch **5d61510dec09e42ad2196c173da5a88f206a85af5809a27562b1daf0cc2f83a5** passed this bounded review. **22 native acceptance groups passed**, no failed or environment-blocked groups. An additional quota-only rerun confirmed that the per-origin override was removed before the disposable browser context closed. It adds cleanup evidence, not two new distinct acceptance cases. No unresolved blocker was found within the callable primitive's declared scope.

This is independent execution on copied, hashed source by `/root/adoption_review`; the author is `/root/portable_calculation` and root remains integrator. Source, tests and application files were not edited by this reviewer. The author reports 74 focused tests and strict TypeScript passing; those are the author's evidence, not another suite run by this reviewer.

